{"uid":"789ebb4419dd2e26","name":"Fund transfer — boundary amounts via TestAxiom BVA","fullName":"tests.ui.test_transfer.TestTransfer#test_boundary_amounts","historyId":"005855aeab38f3558dcff79fa0752c4a","time":{"start":1779874387437,"stop":1779874388111,"duration":674},"description":"\nTestAxiom BVA generates four boundary points for the range (0.01, 100.00):\n  just_below_min=0.0 (invalid), at_min=0.01 (valid),\n  at_max=100.0 (valid),         just_above_max=100.01 (invalid).\nValid boundaries execute a real transfer; invalid ones check for rejection.\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>TestAxiom BVA generates four boundary points for the range (0.01, 100.00):<br />\njust_below_min=0.0 (invalid), at_min=0.01 (valid),<br />\nat_max=100.0 (valid),         just_above_max=100.01 (invalid).<br />\nValid boundaries execute a real transfer; invalid ones check for rejection.</p>\n","status":"skipped","statusMessage":"XFAIL ParaBank demo accepted out-of-bound amount 0.0 (known SUT limitation — no server-side amount validation)\n\n_pytest.outcomes.XFailed: ParaBank demo accepted out-of-bound amount 0.0 (known SUT limitation — no server-side amount validation)","statusTrace":"self = <tests.ui.test_transfer.TestTransfer object at 0x7f8d931c9310>\nlogged_in_page = <Page url='http://localhost:8080/parabank/transfer.htm'>\namount = 0.0, validity = 'invalid'\n\n    @allure.id(\"UI-006\")\n    @allure.title(\"Fund transfer — boundary amounts via TestAxiom BVA\")\n    @allure.severity(allure.severity_level.CRITICAL)\n    @pytest.mark.high\n    @pytest.mark.parametrize(\"amount,validity\", _bva_params)\n    def test_boundary_amounts(self, logged_in_page, amount, validity):\n        \"\"\"\n        TestAxiom BVA generates four boundary points for the range (0.01, 100.00):\n          just_below_min=0.0 (invalid), at_min=0.01 (valid),\n          at_max=100.0 (valid),         just_above_max=100.01 (invalid).\n        Valid boundaries execute a real transfer; invalid ones check for rejection.\n        \"\"\"\n        tp = TransferPage(logged_in_page)\n        tp.goto()\n    \n        # For \"just_above_max\" skip actual execution — ParaBank has no $100 cap.\n        # The BVA point is documented; the system-level limit is account balance.\n        if validity == \"valid\":\n            tp.transfer(amount=str(amount))\n            assert tp.is_success(), f\"BVA {amount}: expected successful transfer\"\n        else:\n            # ParaBank public demo does not enforce strict amount bounds —\n            # out-of-range values are accepted and show \"Transfer Complete!\".\n            # Mark as xfail so the test documents expected SUT behaviour without\n            # blocking the CI green status.\n            tp.transfer(amount=str(amount))\n            if tp.is_success():\n>               pytest.xfail(\n                    f\"ParaBank demo accepted out-of-bound amount {amount} \"\n                    \"(known SUT limitation — no server-side amount validation)\"\n                )\nE               _pytest.outcomes.XFailed: ParaBank demo accepted out-of-bound amount 0.0 (known SUT limitation — no server-side amount validation)\n\ntests/ui/test_transfer.py:57: XFailed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1779874365498,"stop":1779874365499,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1779874365498,"stop":1779874365498,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_session_faker","time":{"start":1779874365499,"stop":1779874365513,"duration":14},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"should